        "topicId": "math-y9-changing-subject",
        "stem": "A model is $y=a(x-2)^2+b$ for x≥2, a>0. At x=3, y=7; at x=5, y=23. A second display shows $z=3y-4$. Which option gives x in terms of z and x when z=107?",
